      "writtenOn": "2026-02-03T14:18:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can get the mode using `BufferBase::MapMode`. And we could always track the pending map buffer as long as it has one of the mappable usages.",
      "revId": "a335988ca841282f1e2ad9882553e5cee907d5f0",
