      "writtenOn": "2026-02-04T14:29:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC `BufferBase::MapMode` only reflects the last map mode user chose for `MapAsync`. In our eager mapping mode, we do the map before user even calls `MapAsync`, hence at this point, `BufferBase::MapMode` is none.\n\nAnw, I have changed the map mode for eager mapping to be based on mappable usages which can be computed at creation.",
